# Enterprise Cyber Risk Register

## Overview

Developed a cybersecurity risk register containing enterprise cyber, cloud, vendor, compliance and operational risks.

## Scope

- Identity & Access Management
- Vulnerability Management
- Third-Party Risk Management
- Cloud Security
- Compliance & Audit
- Incident Response
- Business Continuity & Disaster Recovery

## Deliverables

- Enterprise Risk Register
- Risk Scoring Matrix
- Risk Treatment Plans
- Risk Ownership Assignment

## Frameworks Used

- ISO 27001:2022
- NIST Cybersecurity Framework (CSF)
- CIS Controls

## Key Outcomes

- 34 identified cybersecurity risks
- Risk prioritization using likelihood and impact scoring
- Defined mitigation and residual risk strategies
- Governance and compliance alignment
